          <label class="manual-control-text" title="DAYTRADE＝只模擬進場當日；SWING＝允許跨交易日延續固定停損、移動停利水位與成本保本。手動回測可模擬 LONG/SHORT；A18_21 真單目前僅允許 SWING LONG。">持有模式 <select id="simHoldingMode"><option value="DAYTRADE">DAYTRADE 當日</option><option value="SWING">SWING 跨日</option></select></label>
