function clockSeconds(text,fallback){const m=String(text||'').match(/^(\d{1,2}):(\d{2})(?::(\d{2}))?/);return m?(+m[1])*3600+(+m[2])*60+(+(m[3]||0)):fallback}
function overnightWindow(){const now=taipeiDayAndSeconds(),prompt=clockSeconds(state.runtimeHealth?.dayTradeOvernightPromptTime,13*3600+20*60),deadline=clockSeconds(state.runtimeHealth?.dayTradeAutoCloseTime,13*3600+23*60);return{...now,prompt,deadline}}
function unresolvedDayTradeRows(rows=monitorRowsCache){return(rows||[]).filter(x=>String(x.status)==='Active'&&String(x.holdingMode)==='DayTrade'&&!x.fullyClosedByFill)}
async function setDynamicTrailingShadow(id,enabled){await liveJson(`/api/runtime21/takeovers/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/dynamic-trailing-shadow`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({enabled})});await loadPositionMonitor({render:true,forcePrompt:false})}
async function setMonitorHoldingMode(id,mode){const row=monitorRowsCache.find(x=>String(x.takeoverId)===String(id));if(!row)throw new Error('找不到監控策略');if(mode==='Swing'&&String(row.holdingMode)!=='Swing'){if(!confirm(`${row.symbol} ${row.name||''}\n將由 DAYTRADE 轉為 SWING 跨日。\n\n原成交均價 ${monitorFmt(row.averagePrice)}、停損/停利參數與目前策略水位會保留，下一交易日繼續執行。是否確認？`))return}await liveJson(`/api/runtime21/takeovers/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/holding-mode`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({holdingMode:mode})});await loadPositionMonitor({render:true,forcePrompt:false})}
function renderOvernightPrompt(rows){const modal=$('overnightPrompt'),list=$('overnightPromptList'),title=$('overnightPromptTitle'),message=$('overnightPromptMessage'),later=$('overnightPromptLater');if(!modal||!list||!title||!message||!later)return;const w=overnightWindow(),pending=unresolvedDayTradeRows(rows);if(w.sec<w.prompt||!pending.length||overnightPromptDismissedKey===w.day){modal.classList.remove('open');return}const pastDeadline=w.sec>=w.deadline;title.textContent=pastDeadline?'最後平倉時間後未完結':'日內策略跨日確認';message.textContent=pastDeadline?'以下 DAYTRADE 已超過最後平倉時間但策略仍未完結。ForcedExitTime 應已觸發出場，請立即核對 A18_21 Decision 與券商實際委託／庫存，確認是否有拒單、阻擋或尚未成交。':'13:20 後仍未完結的日內策略，請決定是否轉為跨日。未轉跨日的標的會維持日內狀態，並在最後平倉時間由 A18_21 ForcedExitTime 規則觸發出場。';later.textContent=pastDeadline?'關閉提醒':'稍後決定';list.innerHTML=pending.map(x=>`<div class="overnight-row"><div><strong>${esc(x.symbol)} ${esc(x.name||'')}</strong><div class="monitor-meta">${esc(x.direction)} · ${Number(x.managedQuantity||0).toLocaleString('zh-TW')} 股 · 原成交均價 ${monitorFmt(x.averagePrice)}</div></div>${pastDeadline?'<span class="monitor-neg">ForcedExitTime 後仍未完結</span>':`<button type="button" data-overnight-id="${esc(x.takeoverId)}">轉為跨日</button>`}</div>`).join('');modal.classList.add('open')}
function monitorDeadlineNote(x){if(String(x.status)!=='Active'||String(x.holdingMode)!=='DayTrade'||x.fullyClosedByFill)return'';const w=overnightWindow();if(w.sec<w.prompt)return`<div class="monitor-deadline">日內策略：13:20 會詢問是否轉跨日；未轉跨日者會在最後平倉時間（預設 13:23）由 ForcedExitTime 觸發出場。</div>`;if(w.sec<w.deadline)return`<div class="monitor-deadline">尚未轉跨日。請在最後平倉時間前決定；轉跨日會保留原成交均價與策略狀態。</div>`;return`<div class="monitor-deadline urgent">已超過最後平倉時間但策略仍是 DAYTRADE；請核對 ForcedExitTime Decision、券商委託與實際庫存。</div>`}
