nabled:$('liveHoldingMode').value!=='SWING',time:`${(/^\d{2}:\d{2}$/.test($('simForcedExitTime').value)?$('simForcedExitTime').value:'13:23')}:00`},adverseStepTrade:{enabled:false,everyTwd:0,quantity:0,mode:'Add'}},exitTradingBudgetTwd:0,note:`source=A18_2 swing; symbol=${symbol}; selectedDate=${$('date').value}${referenceNote}`}}
async function sendLiveOrder(){if(!liveEligibility())return;const p=createLivePayload(),paper=$('executionMode').value==='PAPER';if($('preOrderDetectorEnabled')?.checked&&!(await preOrderDetectorConfirm(p.direction)))return;const reference=liveReferenceBar();if(!confirm(`${paper?'PAPER 虛擬單':'REAL 真單'}\n\n股票：${p.symbolOrName}\n方向：${p.direction}\n股數：${p.quantityShares}\n參考價：${reference?fmtP(reference.close):'—'}\n\n${paper?'不會送至元大；會建立隔離的 PAPER 部位。':'警告：這會送出 REAL 真實委託。'}\n是否繼續？`))return;$('liveSend').disabled=true;try{if(paper){await liveJson('/api/runtime21/paper/entries',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({plan:p,referencePrice:reference?Number(reference.close):null})});await loadPaperAccount();}else{const row=await liveJson('/api/runtime21/entries',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(p)});state.activeEntryId=row.id;sessionStorage.setItem(liveSessionKey,row.id);state.liveEntry=row;state.liveEntries=[row,...state.liveEntries.filter(x=>String(x.id).toLowerCase()!==String(row.id).toLowerCase())]}await pollRuntime21()}catch(e){$('liveDecisions').textContent=`建立${paper?'PAPER':'REAL'}計畫失敗：${e.message}`}finally{liveEligibility()}}
